From 8352ef91bc9e32184f35a1345661673c637f7288 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alaric McKenzie-Boone <alaric.mckenzie.boone@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 03:21:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 13/17] Add opt-in second-captain engine primitives and slot-1
 binding (#130)

Lane 12 scaffolding for a second captain, default off. Adds additive
Navi/NaviMgr queries (getNaviIndex/getOtherNaviIndex, getOtherNavi,
getActiveNavi, getAliveOrima, getDeadOrima, setActiveNavi, informOrimaDead,
isNaviDead, hasSecondNavi) backed by an engine-free P2CaptainRoster, and
routes the pc_p2_captain adapter's switch/capture/knockout back into the
engine helpers. pc_p2_captain now binds slot 1 when a second Navi exists and
refuses safely otherwise.

The PIKMIN_P2_SECOND_CAPTAIN opt-in path only prepares mNaviShapeObject[1];
the live spawn is gated shut because follow-AI, split camera, control routing
and survivor-gated game over are not ported yet. Default single-captain play
is unchanged.

Tests: tools/test_p2_captain_roster.cpp (PASS P2_CAPTAIN_ROSTER) and extended
tools/test_p2_captain_adapter.cpp (PASS P2_CAPTAIN_ADAPTER).
